<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<style>
p {
  margin: 30px;
  padding: 10px;
}
p.ex1 {
  border: 1px solid black;
  outline: 3px solid red;
  outline-offset: 15px;
  height: 50px;
  width: 200px;
}

p.ex2 {
  border: 1px solid black;
  outline: 3px solid red;
  outline-offset: -5px;
  background: yellow;
  height: 50px;
  width: 300px;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<h2>The outline-offset Property</h2>

<p class="ex1">This paragraph has a black border and a red outline 15px outside the border edge.</p>

<p class="ex2">This paragraph has a black border and a red outline -5px outside the border edge.</p>

</body>
</html>


